son forgot to write it down, or the seeds are never coming back. Each of those calls for a different tool. If the main problem is people forgetting to record returns, the fix is making returns quick to log. If the main problem is not knowing who to follow up with, the fix is reminders and a clear \"still out\" list. If returns are genuinely open-ended, the tool needs to track seasons and saved seed rather than due dates.\n\nWhen you look at those empty Date back cells, what do you think is usually behind them?","ttft_ms":4049,"type":"result","duration_ms":7290,"uuid":"fd2451eb-ae29-485f-94d8-3886567592dc","ttft_stream_ms":1730,"time_to_request_ms":53,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":2,"system_prompt":12,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":3,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":0,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":2,"init_frame_send":1,"engine_pickup":0,"loop_entry":1,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":0,"request_announcements":2,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":22,"tool_schema_build":0,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":2,"request_build":1},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":3,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":99,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"model","slowest_producer_ms":0,"cpu_ms":4,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":0,"ambient_wait_ms":0,"render_ms":1,"producers":43,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":1730,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
